# Seq annotation: @Seq resolves to App(TyCon("Seq"), Unknown) in TypeAssert position and
# in function parameter annotations. [@Seq val] checks that val is a sequence;
# the value passes through unchanged. Seq@String (bare Annotated form) resolves
# to App(TyCon("Seq"), Str) via resolve_annotated — only valid as a standalone expression,
# not in function parameter position (where the parser accepts bare @Seq only).
[f: [fn [let xs@Seq] xs]
 seq_assert: [@Seq [seq 1 [seq 2 []]]]
 param_seq: [f [seq "a" [seq "b" []]]]]
=== error
[E011] type assertion failed: expected Seq[_], got Seq (defined at 6:20-6:38) (materialized at 6:14-6:39)
  note: value produced here at 6:20-6:38
